=== Angles

==== Radians and Degrees Relationship

A radian is the angle subtended by an arc equal in length to the radius of the circle. The relationship between radians and degrees is:

$ "radians" = "degrees" times pi/180 $
$ "degrees" = "radians" times 180/pi $

One full rotation is $2pi$ radians or $360degree$.

